{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424900/extras/1195409aca663c144045e64b8461361b.avif?t=1759343759\" width=595 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728 is an adult visual novel with point-and-click exploration, placing you in the role of a rebellious wizard who\u2019s just inherited an ancient academy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424900/extras/98b4f5fc0631e8816225dba319e369cb.avif?t=1759343759\" width=595 height=219 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Freya (appearing as a mysterious cat), you begin restoring its halls, recruiting your first student, and testing the boundaries of the Ministry\u2019s outdated magical system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424900/extras/86e1741e62154ce48425190b4003c206.avif?t=1759343759\" width=595 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through nearby locations to gather resources and uncover secrets, encountering characters like merchant, innkeeper, herbalist, a local fisherman, and Silvana\u2014who shares your first intimate scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Magic &amp; Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn basic spells from your spellbook and undertake brief side quests, including banishing an elemental threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academy Restoration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair portions of the castle, attract your first aspiring mage, Athena, and help her gather items via point-and-click mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steamy Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > enjoy adult scenes that deepen your wizard\u2019s personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of your fledgling academy in LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728, and prepare for the rising conflict as you challenge the magical world\u2019s status quo.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/db7f70aea7b9e49fa2a0656697a8f506f302d803.jpg"},{"name":"Art critic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/71b1ab332d7bbb6740a1a629bb0f55c16f11db93.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist of the magical world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/f9e8e9c6cff068fd7b01f5d62c8f1e36083a79da.jpg"},{"name":"The end is just the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/b6ac344358853dccd6d22e459d6c37789e82cdcf.jpg"},{"name":"Aspiring sorcerer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/c96ff0f15d7f150f719d59c536cd569d83909488.jpg"},{"name":"Now you can have fish soup too","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/65fdfff7a84425c7648437a7197a94a2086ee66c.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/ebb69b846d4b84d54455c7c4d685b0efca02bb21.jpg"},{"name":"Gardener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/a7d9a5758337b1bb01c13fd91de5409d93b84d50.jpg"},{"name":"Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/91dae993424a692c96f7fbfb7429f740e10cc012.jpg"},{"name":"Guide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424900/db6d38f296108b13f3f2dd3fb419e9eefddc2113.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424900?t=1759343759","ba